l":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#po-ui-quirks--família-forms--inputs","content":"po-stepper"},"3444":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-26","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#po-ui-quirks--família-forms--inputs","content":"`[p-current-active-step]` não existe (NG8002); `back()` não limpa 'done'"},"3445":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-27","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#po-ui-quirks--família-forms--inputs","content":"Input: `[p-step]`. Output: `(p-change-step)`. `steps` como `signal<PoStepperItem[]>` com `goToStep()`"},"3446":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-28","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#po-ui-quirks--família-forms--inputs","content":"17"},"3447":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-29","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#po-ui-quirks--família-forms--inputs","content":"po-decimal / po-number"},"3448":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-30","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#po-ui-quirks--família-forms--inputs","content":"Input numérico alinhado à esquerda"},"3449":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-31","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#po-ui-quirks--família-forms--inputs","content":"CSS global em `styles.scss`: `po-decimal input, po-number input \\{ text-align: right; \\}`"},"3450":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-32","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#2-po-input-bottom-padding-misaligns-buttons-8px-offset","content":"**Symptom:** Buttons placed in the same flex row as `po-input` fields appear 8px lower\nthan the visible input field edge, even with `align-items: flex-end` on the container."},"3451":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-33","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#2-po-input-bottom-padding-misaligns-buttons-8px-offset","content":"**Root cause:** `po-input` renders a wrapper that includes an invisible 8px space below\nthe visible input field, reserved for validation error messages. `flex-end` aligns to the\nbottom of this wrapper (including the invisible 8px), not to the bottom of the visible field."},"3452":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-34","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#2-po-input-bottom-padding-misaligns-buttons-8px-offset","content":"**Fix:** Add `margin-bottom: 8px` to the button element or its container."},"3453":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-35","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#4-po-input-p-maxlength-binding-name","content":"**Symptom:** Angular compilation error: `NG8002: Can't bind to 'p-max-length' since it isn't a known property of 'po-input'`."},"3454":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-36","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#4-po-input-p-maxlength-binding-name","content":"**Root cause:** The correct Angular input alias is `p-maxlength` (no hyphen between `max` and `length`)."},"3455":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-37","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#13-po-dynamic-form-p-value-change-não-existe-confirmado-po-ui-v172628","content":"**Symptom:** Binding `(p-value-change)=\"myHandler($event)\"` on `po-dynamic-form` compiles\nwithout errors but the handler is never called, regardless of what the user types."},"3456":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-38","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#13-po-dynamic-form-p-value-change-não-existe-confirmado-po-ui-v172628","content":"**Root cause:** `PoDynamicFormBaseComponent` declares only one `@Output`: `outputs: \\{ formOutput: \"p-form\" \\}`.\nThere is no `p-value-change` output. Angular silently ignores unknown event bindings — no error, no warning."},"3457":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-39","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#13-po-dynamic-form-p-value-change-não-existe-confirmado-po-ui-v172628","content":"**Fix: use `(p-form)` para receber o `NgForm`, depois subscribir em `form.valueChanges`.**"},"3458":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-40","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#13-po-dynamic-form-p-value-change-não-existe-confirmado-po-ui-v172628","content":"**Notas:**"},"3459":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-41","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#13-po-dynamic-form-p-value-change-não-existe-confirmado-po-ui-v172628","content":"`form.valueChanges` dispara a cada tecla em `po-decimal`/`po-number` e no blur em campos texto"},"3460":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-42","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#13-po-dynamic-form-p-value-change-não-existe-confirmado-po-ui-v172628","content":"`[(p-value)]` two-way binding também falha silenciosamente — usar `[p-value]` (one-way) para inicialização e atualizar `headerValues` no subscribe"},"3461":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-43","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#13-po-dynamic-form-p-value-change-não-existe-confirmado-po-ui-v172628","content":"